ask net_worth: sum(bal(x, d) with uncertain for x in places over .. where not x in outside and ((x in accounts or x in cash or x in claims or x in debts) and unit(x) == PLN)) + sum(value(wunits[w], d) in PLN by etf_price[month_of(d)] for w in wrapper) for d in [2026-12-31] law cut

ask replay_september: residuals konto 2026-09 law cut

ask taxes_paid: flows(urzad_skarbowy, y) for y in [2026] law cut
